<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">Teke-Tyee</book>
  <para style="h">2 TIMOTE</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukaana a Poole wu a myele kundaa Timote</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukaana wu a myele kundaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timote</para>
  <para style="imt">OSOMO</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu mukaana a Poole wu a myele wu ásono nde kundaa Timote. Nde ásono mukaana wu mu matala ma áli nde mu boloko ku Rome. Bandughu ba nde bwohono bábara ya bábulusihi nde. Yini a Luke, ngaa-libughu wuulu ka asihi nde o.</para>
  <para style="ip">Poole amono ti matala ma nde ayi maafi, yini a lipfu liisyili. Mu obo nde ágwolo mukakana mu osono mukaana wu kundaa Timote mu ogwa nde maluo, mu kuulu nde ágwolo nde ti anga nkara mwana a nde. Mukaana wu li wu masini wu ósono Poole.</para>
  <para style="ip">Poole ályele kundaa Timote munsa mukaana wu mu okwara kana ti anga nde. Nde áluomo nde mu osa mukama mu okatsala Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Yiisu, ngu okala ti bákamwehẽ nde kimini. Ya mu osa mayele ya mandagha maala ka mali embe-embe ya Nsia yi Mbwe o.</para>
  <para style="ip">Poole bwehe ti ndeme si ádzwana mvulu yi mbwe, ya edzi-dzighi nde sa ayibvuŋunu ya Mfumu Yiisu. Nde ályele ti nswe mukriste faana osa ti anga nde.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">Bu me bu baakakaba mukaana wu:</para>
  <para style="io1">- Mamboro (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1.1-2</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Poole gwi Timote luo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:3-18">1.3-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Okala mbumbulu a Kriste wu mubwe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:1-26">2.1-26</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Bu okala baara mu bitsughu bibi masini (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 3:1-9">3.1-9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Okwara kana mu mpini (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 3:10-4:8">3.10–4.8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Mansia ya mamboro mama masini (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:9-22">4.9-22</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mamboro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Me Poole, ntumu a Yiisu-Kriste mu waa li Nzaami, bwunu a bu oli misiini mi bumweẽ bu buli mu Yiisu-Kriste, <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />nsono mukaana wu kundaa Timote, mwana a me wu mukolo. Nyaã ti bwehe, nyiĩ ya edzuunu bi bifi kundaa Nzaami Taara ya kundaa Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste bikala ya we!<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole bvurulu matuono kundaa Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Me aakamvurulu matuono malagha kundaa Nzaami, wu aakansalala me mu bitsimi bibi tse-tse ti anga bu ósalala bankagha ba me. Matala mwohono, me aakansamana mu we mpyibi ya mwiĩ. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Me aakandibili mweẽ mu mansaŋa ma we, ya me ndi a nzala a omono we kuu olagha mpaala me ndwulu mu esee. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Me aakandibili si mweẽ mu kana li we lili ngaŋma, bwunu a bu óli kana li nkagha a we Loyidze ya lili ngughu a we Enise. Me ngyighili osoolo ti kana lilo lili si mu we.<verse eid="2TI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omono mpara ya Poole mu nkooro a Nsia yi Mbwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Mu obo, me ndibili we mweẽ mu ofirifulu mbaa a ekaba ki ógwi we Nzaami mu matala ma ánaŋa me we myaã ŋa yulu a mutswi. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Mu kuulu, Nzaami ka ágwi bihi-a-be mufulu wu a nzalamweẽ o, lo mufulu wu a mpini, wu a dzyi ya wu okakuru nyuru. <verse eid="2TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Ka kala a budzwa mu osuo bumpughulu bu Mfumu a bihi o, ka kala a budzwa mu me wu ndi mu boloko mu nkooro a nde o. Lo mono mpara ya me mu nkooro a Nsia yi Mbwe mu lileene li Nzaami.<verse eid="2TI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Nde wu aabvwuhu bihi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:9">ya wu aati bihi mbili mu okala a bumweẽ bubu ngili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:9">ka mu nkooro a bigyighili bi bihi bi bibwe o,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:9">lo bwunu a bu oli bitsimi bi ákuru nde, bwunu a bu oli bwehe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:9">bu bágwi bihi mu Yiisu-Kriste</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:9">nsomo nde agyighili bilogho byehene.<verse eid="2TI 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Mu matala ma, bwehe bubo buumoŋono ŋa omoŋono Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:10">wu aamana lileene li lipfu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 1:10">ya wu aasuo ŋa tse-tse laama lili mibvu ya mibvu mu nzili a Nsia yi Mbwe.<verse eid="2TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Me mu nkooro a Nsia yi Mbwe oyo Nzaami aasuolo me mu okala wu aakata mukwughu, ntumu ya muluo. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Me mu nkooro a ndagha oyo me ndi mu okamono mpara yi. Lo me ka ndi a budzwa mu ndagha oyo o, mu kuulu me ngyahaba mu nande me aansi kana. Ya me ndi a emiini ti nde li a lileene mu okebe ma ágwi nde me tee mu etsughu ekye.<verse eid="2TI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Kwara, mu kana ya mu dzyi li lili mu Yiisu-Kriste, efaana ki mandagha mama nsumu ma ágyughu we kundaa me. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Kebe, mu nzili a Mufulu a Ngili wu li mu bihi, mandagha mwohono ma mabwe ma bágwi we.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bunsumu bu Onesifore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />We soolo ti baara bwohono ba bali ku Adzi baanyaghala me. Fingele ya Eremongene bali mu mutala a bo. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Nyaã Mfumu amono nzo a Onesifore nyiĩ mu kuulu matala malagha, nde aakagwa me mpini, ya ka aakamono budzwa mu me wu ndi mu boloko o. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Me mu obo, nde bu aagyi ku bvulu lili Rome, nde aasi maswa mu osagha me ya nde aamono me. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Nyaã Mfumu Yiisu agwa nde bwehe mu etsughu kii mumfwunu, mpaala Nzaami amono nde nyiĩ. We weme gyighili osoolo obvulu baara bwohono ti ku bvulu lili Efedze, nde áabaha bihi.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mbumbulu a Kriste wu a nsumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Mu obo mwana a me, we ngu wuulu gwama mu bwehe bu buli mu Yiisu-Kriste. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Ya mandagha mwohono ma ágyughu we kundaa me ŋa nkulu a bampughulu balagha, gwa mo kundaa baara ba bakughu osa kana mu mo ya baala boho si bakughu oluo mo kundaa babake. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Mono mpara ya me ti anga mbumbulu a Yiisu-Kriste wu mubwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Ka oli a mbumbulu wu li mu esala wu aafirikasa ndagha nkimi o ya baara baala ka bali ba mbumbulu o, kala ti nde dzyi ogwa mbwuru wu aagwolo nde mu esala esee. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Wu aakasa bimpa ka kughu obagha muburu wu a ba baakalughulu o, kala ti nde ka si bimpa bwunu a bu oli mikyene mi bimpa o. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Mukunu manseghe wu aakamono mpara mu osala nseghe faana okala wu a nsomo mu obagha kaba li nde lili bimburu. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Baghala mandagha ma ndyele me we ya Mfumu sa agwa we mayele mu mandagha mwohono.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olibili mweẽ mu Yiisu-Kriste wu aasighili ŋa kara li ba bákpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Libili mweẽ mu Yiisu-Kriste wu aasighili ŋa kara li ba bákpi, ya wu aapala mu musyi a dzumu li Dabvide, ti bwunu a bu ookalyele Nsia yi Mbwe yi aakantsala me. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Mu nkooro a yo me ndi mu okakuru mukolo mu mpara yi ndi mu okamono me, ya me ndi munsa boloko ti anga ntwumu. Lo ndagha a Nzaami ka yili munsa boloko o. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Me mu obo me aakankuru mukolo mu mandagha mwohono mu nkooro a babo ba ósuolo Nzaami, mpaala boho si babagha obvwughu ku oli mu Yiisu-Kriste, ya nsia yi a mibvu ya mibvu. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Ndagha yi yili yi a ngaŋma:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">«Kala ti bihi liikpi ya nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">bihi si sa likala mweẽ emõ ya nde,<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />kala ti bihi lisi mukama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">bihi si sa litumu si ya nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">kala ti bihi libihi nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">ndehe si sa abihi bihi,<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />kala ti bihi ligwene a kana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">nde li wu bafaana osa kana mu nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">mu kuulu nde ka kughu otunu ndeme o.»<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musala wuulu ka faana omono budzwa o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Mamo me mandagha ma faana we okalibili bo mweẽ, gyehe bo ŋa nkulu a Nzaami ti babara mimbaŋana mu bitsuo biili ka bili a esala o, kala ti ka yini obyihi ba baakagyughu mimbaŋana mimye o. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Sa mpini mu omoŋono ŋa nkulu a Nzaami ti anga mbwuru wu aakagwa Nzaami esee, musala wuulu ka li a budzwa mu esala e nde o, ya wu aakaluo Ndagha yi a engaŋma mu bunsumu. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Lo we ka somo mu mbiili a baara yi a mukaŋana o, yiili ka yifaana ya kana o. Baara ba bali a bipfu bibye sa bakagye linkulu kunsa bubi bu bubvulu matala mwohono. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Maluo mabo mali ti anga eboŋo ki eekanyaã. Imene ya Filete bali mu mutala a baara babo. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Bo baamara mu nzili yi a engaŋma, bu baakalyele ti osighili mu lipfu áyi óluru ya bo baakabwihi kana li ndaama a baara.<verse eid="2TI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bitsini bi bibagha bi nzo bi otwuu Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Lo bitsini bi bibagha bibi mpini bi ootwuu Nzaami bili nkini ya mpini. Mu bye bási binyeme mu mandagha ma: <char style="qt">Mfumu gyahaba ba bali baara ba nde</char> ya: <char style="qt">Nyaã nswe wu aataŋana nkwumu a Mfumu akala la ya ogwene a bunsumu!</char> <verse eid="2TI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Ankoho munsa nzo yi nene ka ookakala yini a mandoŋo mama oore ya mama ngele o, lo oli si a mandoŋo ma bágyighili mu miti ya mama mu mubweẽ. Mama nsomo me ma baakasalala mu bitsughu bibi byiri, mamake ma baakasalala nswe etsughu. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Mu obo, kala ti mbwuru kala wu a tse-tse bu akaghaba ya mandagha mwohono ma mabi ma aandyele me, nde sa akala ti anga elogho ki baakasalala mu budziri, elogho ki báseme, ki eli mupfunu kundaa mfumu a nde, ki bakughu osalala mu nswe esala ki ebwe.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musala a Mfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Aakabara enzyi-a-nzyi kii bufulu ya aakanama bunsumu, kana, dzyi, edzuunu emõ ya babo ba baakasamana Mfumu mu mukolo wu a tse-tse. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Aakabihi minsohobo mimi bwunu ya mimi buwulu. We gyaghaba ti mye miikaburu mimbaŋana. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Mu kuulu musala a Mfumu ka faana okabaŋana o. Nde faana okakala a dzyi mu baara bwohono, nde faana osoolo oluo ya okuru mukolo ŋa nkulu a baara baala ka bali bitsimi bimo ya nde o. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Nde faana okasyeme mu edzuunu babo ba baala ka bali a bitsimi bimo ya nde o, nkini-a-nki Nzaami kughu osa ti bagyiŋi mayele mu osoolo ligyahaba lili ngaŋma, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />ya mu oyabvughuru mu bitsimi bi bo bi bibwe mpaala bapala mu myere mi dyabulu wu aasyimi bo, mu kuulu bakasalala waa li nde.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mpara yi a matala mama masini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Gyahaba ti mu bitsughu bibi masini, matala mama mpara sa makala. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Mu kuulu baara sa bakala banga a bi, banga a ntono a nzi, banga a masyighi, banga a ligwagha, ba baakatsaala Nzaami, ba baakabihi litumu li biburu bi bo, ba baakabihi okihi bubwe bu baasi bo ya ba bagwene a budziri mu bibi ngili, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />banga a mikolo ngyi, ba bagwene a nyiĩ, banga a makuhu, ba baagwene okaleene okuru nyuru, banga a dzighi, mitaara mi mandagha ma mabwe, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />ba baakatyeghe banganda, banga a mankehe, ba ódzwi ligwagha mihi, ba baakadzyi bisee bi nyuru ku obvulu Nzaami. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Bo sa bakala a efa ki eemoŋono ti kii enzaami, lo bo sa batunu lileene li Nzaami. Kala la ya baara babo.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Mu kuulu, ndaama a baara mu bo yili mu okabulusomo mu mayele mu manzo mu osa kunsa litumu li bo bakaha ba bali a kana li lisala, baala ya leme li masumu ya enzyi-a-nzyi. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Matala mwohono bo bali mu okagyighi, lo ka bali mu okasoolo ligyahaba lili engaŋma o. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Bwunu a bu áli otemene Dzanese ya Dzamberese Moyidze ngangala mu matala ma makulu, bwunu obo si baara babo bali mu okatemene engaŋma ngangala. Bo bali a mayele ma magwimi ya kana li bo ka lili mubwughu o. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Lo bo ka baagye la o, mu kuulu baara bwohono sa basoolo buwulu bu bo, bwunu a bu áli basoolo buwulu bu Dzanese ya Dzamberese.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwara mandagha ma ágyighi we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Lo we Timote aagyighili onama maluo ma me, nzya-nzyara a me, bitsimi bi aankuru me, kana li me, okuru mukolo a me mu okebe, dzyi li me, mukama a me, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />makimini ya mpara a me. We soolo mandagha mwohono ma maabwi mu me ku mabvulu mama Antyose, Ikonyome ya Lisitere, ya nki kimini me aamono. Lo Mfumu aakwulu me mu kimini lwohono. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Mu obo, baara bwohono ba badzyi okala a laama li lili bunsumu mu Nzaami mu bumõ ya Yiisu-Kriste sa bamwehẽ bo kimini. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Lo baara ba babi ya baara banga a mpya sa bakagye linkulu kunsa bubi. Bo sa bapfiri babake, lo baara sa bapfiri boho si.<verse eid="2TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Lo we ngu wuulu kwara mu mpini mandagha ma aagyighi we ya ma aakihi we mu mukolo mumõ. We soolo nande aaluo we mo. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Obaana bugye bu we, we soolo Bisono bibi Ngili. Bye bikughu ogwa we munzeele wu aakabiri ku obvwughu mu nzili a kana mu Yiisu-Kriste. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Bisono byehene Nzaami aagwi mayele mu osono bye ya Bisono byehene bili a mupfunu mu oluo, mu obihi maluo mama mpya, mu osyeme bubi ya mu ogwa luo mu bunsumu bu ookaluomo Nzaami. <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />Mpaala mbwuru a Nzaami akala mukughu ya wu li a bi bifaana mu osa bigyighili byehene bi bibwe.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Tsala nsia a Ndagha a Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Ŋa nkulu a Nzaami ya ŋa nkulu a Yiisu-Kriste wu akala aalamana baba mweẽ ya ba bákpi, ya mu nkwumu a Kriste wu akala aamoŋono kunsa a empu e nde, me ngwi we litumu li: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Aakatsala nsia a Ndagha a Nzaami, aakasa epini mu okaluo yo matala mwohono, ngu okala mu matala ma mabwe bwunu we ma mabi, aakabihi maluo ma mabi, aakasyeme, ŋa aakaluo aakagwa mpama kunsa okuru mukolo mu okebe . <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Mu kuulu, matala sa magya maala baara ka bafiridzyi ogyughu maluo mama nsumu o. Lo bwunu a bu badzyi bo, bo sa basagha okala a baluo balagha ba akala baakabululyele bo mandagha ma badzyi bo okagyughu. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Bo sa babihi okagyughu maluo mama engaŋma, sa bagwuŋumu mu okabulugyughu masaba.<verse eid="2TI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Lo we, aakakala a nzya-nzyara yi faana ya yi budziri mu mandagha mwohono, aakakuru mukolo ŋa nkulu a mpara, aakatsala nsia a Nsia yi Mbwe, aakasala esala e we kii muluo kuu mukughu.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omana obara ntyini ya okebe kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Mu kuulu, mu mi mitala me, matala ma aangye me maato, mu kuulu batsala makili ma me ti anga mukaba. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Me aandzwana mvulu yi mbwe, me aamana obara ntyini, me aankebe kana. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Obaana matala ma, Nzaami aalwunu me muburu wu a bunsumu. Mu etsughu ekye, Mfumu, nsughu a lamana wu a nsumu, sa agwa me nde, ya ka yini a kundaa me aagwa nde o, lo si kundaa baara bwohono ba bali mu okakebe ya dzyi omoŋono o nde.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mansia mama masini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Sa mpini mu obaayamono me. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Mu kuulu, mu nkooro a dzyi li bilogho bi nsie yi, Demase aabulunyaghala me ya aagyene ku bvulu lili Tesalonike. Lo Keresense aagyene ku etsulu e nsie kii Ngalati, ya Tite ku etsulu e nsie kii Dalamati. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Yini a Luk li ya me. Gwolo Mareke ya ligya ya nde, nde li mupfunu mu esala e me. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Me aangweghe Tisyike ku bvulu lili Efedze. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Ŋa akala aagya we, gya a me enkuru e me ki ela kii kobo ki áli ansihi me kundaa Karapose ku bvulu lili Torowase. Yabiri si mikaana, emvulu-ngughu mikaana mi básono mu bibaana bi banyama.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alesandere muntsulu bisyeẽ aamwehẽ me mpara yi alagha. Mfumu sa abvurulu nde bwunu a bu oli bigyighili bi nde. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Wehe si, sa mayele mu nde, mu kuulu nde aatemene maluo ma bihi ngangala mu ebaghala.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Mu matala ma aakankala me nyuru a me ŋa nkulu a bansughu-a-lamana mu sa lili nsomo, me aandi ngasighi. Baara bwohono baanyaghala me. Nzaami anyaã osyeme bo mu ndagha oyo! <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Mfumu ndeme aabaha me ya aagwi me mpini mpaala mu me Nsia yitsaŋama mu eteese kii mukughu, ya mpaala ba baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o bagyughu yo. Ya nde aakwulu me ŋa muŋma a nkoho! <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Mfumu sa akwulu me mu mandagha mwohono ma mabi ya nde sa abvwuhu me mu nkooro a Emfumu e nde kii mayulu. Nyaã nsia yikala kundaa nde mu mibvu ya mibvu! <char style="qt">Aamene!</char><verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mamboro mama masini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Gwa Pirisika ya Akila mamboro, gwa nzo a Onesifore mboro. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erasete aabulusyili ku bvulu lili Korente ya me aabulunsihi Torofime mubyele ku bvulu lili Mile.<verse eid="2TI 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Sa mpini mu ogya nsomo lito mu ndo yi a mpie yi alagha. Ebulose, Pudense, Linuse, Kolodya, ya bandughu mu kana bwohono bagwi we mamboro.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Nyaã Mfumu akala ya mufulu a we!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 4:22">Nyaã bwehe bu Nzaami bukala ya be!<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>